18T18:11:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116355","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116355.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116355.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-18T18:11:04Z"},"body":"Fixes #102173.\r\n\r\nChanges the function implementations to use `GetBudget`/`vmaGetHeapBudgets` instead of the significantly more expensive \"calculate\" variants. This reduces the cost of the functions to the point I can't even see them in CPU profilers anymore.\r\n\r\nNotes:\r\n- D3D12 used to provide the block allocation size, but I changed it to the resource allocation size for consistency with Vulkan.\r\n- Lazy memory size unfortunately cannot be gathered this way because it requires information from the individual memory types, which `vmaGetHeapBudgets` does not provide.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url